WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.191
Ablations confirm the design.

00:00:02.271 --> 00:00:06.186
Adding a grounding term, phi of a goal with itself,

00:00:06.266 --> 00:00:10.181
as a normalizing constant in psi's objective helps.

00:00:10.261 --> 00:00:12.922
An L1 metric loss for phi beats L2.

00:00:13.002 --> 00:00:17.700
And varying the latent dimensionality barely
changes control.
